            {
                "entry_id": "b21ab134-e5e6-3bb7-8828-7923ffde1feb",
                "word": "futon",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "1ac4d5e8-7e83-4b9d-adf2-b6ae57385db7",
                        "entry_id": "b21ab134-e5e6-3bb7-8828-7923ffde1feb",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "futons"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "797fd03b-19d6-38ea-add7-2f65ca613678",
                        "entry_id": "b21ab134-e5e6-3bb7-8828-7923ffde1feb",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Lit constitué d’un matelas très ferme pouvant se plier et ainsi constituer un divan."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "dda7aeca-7ebc-4614-b431-8f24eef4505e",
                                "sense_id": "797fd03b-19d6-38ea-add7-2f65ca613678",
                                "text": "Je regardai avec émotion ce futon, imaginant mon élève qui y avait traversé les années, un livre à la main."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8a84ccb8-8480-4a66-b5b5-56685b787b5c",
                                "sense_id": "797fd03b-19d6-38ea-add7-2f65ca613678",
                                "text": "J'allumai mon ventilateur. Je paramétrai mon téléphone pour qu'il bipât dans deux heures et fort. Je dépliai mon futon et me couchai."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7b0aed48-3091-49b2-88d0-ea00904b4785",
                                "sense_id": "797fd03b-19d6-38ea-add7-2f65ca613678",
                                "text": "La fatigue du voyage a raison de nous. Nous retournons à la ryokan, je m’effondre sur le futon."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "e9e58302-2950-46a5-8b80-9a1e76e12493",
                        "source_entry_id": "b21ab134-e5e6-3bb7-8828-7923ffde1feb",
                        "source_sense_id": "797fd03b-19d6-38ea-add7-2f65ca613678",
                        "target_lang_word": "futon",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "futon",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0c35048f-1bf2-33c1-b21f-7769cc1646b4",
                                        "entry_id": "f7ca1fb1-75fe-3a1e-8da4-e5af2db5eccf",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A thin mattress of tufted cotton or similar material, placed on a floor or on a raised, foldable frame as a bed."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "aac900d4-2f8d-40cb-a4d3-80e68e925618",
                                                "sense_id": "0c35048f-1bf2-33c1-b21f-7769cc1646b4",
                                                "text": "The Japanese bed is the floor, with a wooden box under the neck for a pillow and a futon for a covering. To the foreigner the Japanese landlord allows five or six futons, or cotton-wadded comforters, and they make a tolerable mattress, although not springy, and rather apt to be damp and musty."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c93833bb-b42b-4be3-bca5-6a627020d64e",
                                                "sense_id": "0c35048f-1bf2-33c1-b21f-7769cc1646b4",
                                                "text": "The futon are easily aired, and may be carried about readily when moving."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "191ad47f-a83f-46ca-9d5f-083ce112af52",
                                                "sense_id": "0c35048f-1bf2-33c1-b21f-7769cc1646b4",
                                                "text": "Normally one or two futon are laid on tatami, several inches of straw matting recessed into the floor, providing a firm but extremely comfortable night’s rest."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ac37eb33-14fd-417f-87ee-bcbc97f301e9",
                                                "sense_id": "0c35048f-1bf2-33c1-b21f-7769cc1646b4",
                                                "text": "Some futon (cotton-filled comforters and mattresses) were piled in one corner and few clothing belonging to father hung on some nails on the wall."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a6a8c4e3-ac60-36c7-b9a1-d972538934d3",
                                        "entry_id": "f7ca1fb1-75fe-3a1e-8da4-e5af2db5eccf",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A round cushion used for Zen meditation, traditionally made of woven bulrush leaves."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0316beb6-ed92-399f-81dd-e3b804bcfa01",
                                        "entry_id": "f7ca1fb1-75fe-3a1e-8da4-e5af2db5eccf",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A specific kind of sofa-bed, with a fixed cushion that forms a mattress when folded down and a sofa when folded up."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b1d51d8a-9723-4631-99a3-17e8bdc1a4b4",
                                                "sense_id": "0316beb6-ed92-399f-81dd-e3b804bcfa01",
                                                "text": "I was 18 years old, sleeping on a futon, cooking on a George Foreman grill and showering at a friend's house every few days."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "25dbf8dc-69ce-4032-afaf-6e9fb3cff029",
                        "source_entry_id": "b21ab134-e5e6-3bb7-8828-7923ffde1feb",
